      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KILCOY TIGER (8) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 3.5 lengths at this track in a handy 22.96 beating Zipping Deloris. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Well placed and will be tough to beat. CREEPING TIGER (2) has shown good improvement at his last two starts, most recently finishing 2nd at Bulli over 340m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Can measure up. FASCINATE VERN (1) had been racing well with a NG win three back then placed next time before missing the frame latest at this track. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. SAIL AWAY SAM (3) is not to be discarded.",
